<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 96/97 wheat crop forecast at 5 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Hungary 96/97 wheat crop forecast at 5 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Agricultural Ministry said on Monday it expected a five million tonne wheat crop in the 96/97 crop year, compared with 3.9 million tonnes last year.</p>
<p>&quot;We estimate the crop to be slightly under five million tonnes,&quot; State Secretary Fulop Benedek told a news conference.</p>
</text>
